---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { path, t, type Lang } from '../i18n/ui';
import { first, int, last, newVsUsed, one, share } from '../lib/data';
import { bandLine } from '../lib/charts';

interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}

const { lang } = Astro.props;
const L = (pt: string, en: string) => (lang === 'pt' ? pt : en);
const upTo2021 = newVsUsed.filter((r) => r.ref_year <= 2021);
const lo = Math.min(...upTo2021.map((r) => r.median_ratio));
const hi = Math.max(...upTo2021.map((r) => r.median_ratio));
const y2022 = one(newVsUsed, { ref_year: 2022 });
const latest = last(newVsUsed);
const from = first(newVsUsed).ref_year;
const nMin = Math.min(...newVsUsed.map((r) => r.n));
const nMax = Math.max(...newVsUsed.map((r) => r.n));

const chart = bandLine(
  newVsUsed.map((r) => ({ x: r.ref_year, y: r.median_ratio, lo: r.p25_ratio, hi: r.p75_ratio })),
  {
    domain: [0.8, 1],
    yFormat: (v) => share(v, lang),
    labelled: [from, 2021, 2022, latest.ref_year],
    rule: 0.8,
    aria: L(
      'Linha por ano com quanto um carro do ano usado vale do mesmo carro zero km, perto de 90% até 2021 e acima disso depois.',
      'Line per year with what a used car of the current model year is worth next to the same car brand new, near 90% until 2021 and above it afterwards.',
    ),
  },
);
---

<Base lang={lang} page="brandNew" title={L('O mito do zero km', 'The brand-new myth')}>
  <article class="wrap page">
    <p class="eyebrow">{t(lang, 'nav.analyses')}</p>
    <h1>{L('"Zero km perde 20% ao sair da loja": nos dados, perto de 10%', '"A new car loses 20% as it leaves the lot": in the data, about 10%')}</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      {L(
        `De ${from} a 2021, um carro do ano usado valia de ${share(lo, lang)} a ${share(hi, lang)} do mesmo carro zero km. Desde 2022 a diferença ficou menor.`,
        `From ${from} to 2021 a used car of the current model year was worth ${share(lo, lang)} to ${share(hi, lang)} of the same car brand new. Since 2022 the gap has been smaller.`,
      )}
    </p>

    <figure class="figure">
      <Fragment set:html={chart} />
      <figcaption>
        {L(
          'Mediana, por janeiro, do preço do carro usado do ano-modelo corrente dividido pelo preço do mesmo carro zero km (mesmo código FIPE e combustível). A faixa vai do 1º ao 3º quartil; a linha tracejada marca 80%, a perda de 20% do ditado.',
          'Median, per January, of the price of a used car of the current model year divided by the price of the same car brand new (same FIPE code and fuel). The band spans the 1st to 3rd quartile; the dashed line marks 80%, the 20% loss of the saying.',
        )}
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        {L(
          `Em 2022, com o choque dos usados, o carro do ano chegou a ${share(y2022.median_ratio, lang)} do zero km. Em ${latest.ref_year}, ${share(latest.median_ratio, lang)}.`,
          `In 2022, with the used-car shock, a current-year car reached ${share(y2022.median_ratio, lang)} of the brand-new price. In ${latest.ref_year}, ${share(latest.median_ratio, lang)}.`,
        )}
      </p>
      <p>
        {L(
          `Cada ano compara de ${int(nMin, lang)} a ${int(nMax, lang)} carros que têm, no mesmo janeiro, preço de zero km e de usado do ano.`,
          `Each year compares ${int(nMin, lang)} to ${int(nMax, lang)} cars that have, in the same January, both a brand-new price and a current-year used price.`,
        )}
      </p>
      <p class="note">
        {L(
          'O que isso não mede: a FIPE publica um preço médio de mercado, não o desconto que uma loja dá na hora da venda nem o que se paga de taxa no emplacamento. ',
          'What this does not measure: FIPE publishes an average market price, not the discount a dealer gives at the sale or registration fees. ',
        )}
        <a href={path(lang, 'method')}>{t(lang, 'nav.method')}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <details class="data">
      <summary>{t(lang, 'table.show')}</summary>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table class="num">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>{L('Ano', 'Year')}</th>
              <th>{t(lang, 'table.n')}</th>
              <th>{L('Mediana', 'Median')}</th>
              <th>{L('1º quartil', '1st quartile')}</th>
              <th>{L('3º quartil', '3rd quartile')}</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {newVsUsed.map((r) => (
              <tr>
                <td>{r.ref_year}</td>
                <td>{int(r.n, lang)}</td>
                <td>{share(r.median_ratio, lang, 1)}</td>
                <td>{share(r.p25_ratio, lang, 1)}</td>
                <td>{share(r.p75_ratio, lang, 1)}</td>
              </tr>
            ))}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </details>
  </article>
</Base>
